{"seq":2,"slug":"cron-and-scheduled-tasks","title":"Cron 周期任务与 hooks 协同","url":"/l-doc-books/c/ai-books/personal-agents/horizontal-pillars/automation-workflows/cron-and-scheduled-tasks","wordCount":1417,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"cron-周期任务与-hooks-协同\">Cron 周期任务与 hooks 协同</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Personal-agent 的&quot;自动化&quot;价值很大一块来自 cron 周期任务——既不需要用户主动触发，也不依赖外部消息推送。Hermes 的 curator daily 03:00 整理 memory、用户自定义 skill &quot;每天 09:00 拉昨天 memory summary 进 inbox&quot;、月底总结脚本等都属此类。本篇按&quot;Hermes curator schedule + user-defined cron skill + hooks transform 协同 + 失败重试与漂移修正&quot;四块讲清。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  CRON[&quot;Cron scheduler&quot;] --&gt; EV1[&quot;每日 03:00 curator&quot;]&#10;  CRON --&gt; EV2[&quot;每日 09:00 daily-brief skill&quot;]&#10;  CRON --&gt; EV3[&quot;每周一 08:00 weekly-prep&quot;]&#10;  CRON --&gt; EV4[&quot;每月底 23:00 monthly-summary&quot;]&#10;  EV1 --&gt; HK[&quot;Hooks transform pipeline&quot;]&#10;  EV2 --&gt; HK&#10;  EV3 --&gt; HK&#10;  EV4 --&gt; HK&#10;  HK --&gt; SHELL[&quot;Shell side-effect&quot;]&#10;  HK --&gt; NF[&quot;Notification / IM push&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n  CRON[\"Cron scheduler\"] --&gt; EV1[\"每日 03:00 curator\"]\n  CRON --&gt; EV2[\"每日 09:00 daily-brief skill\"]\n  CRON --&gt; EV3[\"每周一 08:00 weekly-prep\"]\n  CRON --&gt; EV4[\"每月底 23:00 monthly-summary\"]\n  EV1 --&gt; HK[\"Hooks transform pipeline\"]\n  EV2 --&gt; HK\n  EV3 --&gt; HK\n  EV4 --&gt; HK\n  HK --&gt; SHELL[\"Shell side-effect\"]\n  HK --&gt; NF[\"Notification / IM push\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>任务类型</th>\n<th>触发频率</th>\n<th>例子</th>\n<th>失败影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Hermes curator</td>\n<td>每日 03:00</td>\n<td>memory 压缩 + 索引重建</td>\n<td>中（次日补跑）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>用户 daily brief</td>\n<td>每日 09:00</td>\n<td>拉前一日 memory 投送 IM</td>\n<td>低（手动可补）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>周/月度总结</td>\n<td>每周/月一次</td>\n<td>总结 + 投送邮件 / 文档</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>系统维护</td>\n<td>任何频率</td>\n<td>log rotate / cache clear</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"hermes-curator-schedule\">Hermes curator schedule</h2><p>Hermes 的 curator 是 <a href=\"../../modules-deep/persistent-memory/curator-maintenance-cycle\"><code>../../2_modules-deep/1_persistent-memory/4_curator-maintenance-cycle.md</code></a> 详述的 memory 维护循环——默认每天本地时间 03:00 运行。它在所有 personas / sessions 全部 idle 后才启动，避免与 active session 抢锁。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# ~/.hermes/config.yaml&#10;curator:&#10;  schedule: &#39;daily&#39;&#10;  at: &#39;03:00&#39;&#10;  tz: &#39;Asia/Shanghai&#39;&#10;  prerequisites:&#10;    - &#39;all_sessions_idle&#39;&#10;    - &#39;disk_free_gb &gt; 5&#39;&#10;  on_failure:&#10;    - &#39;log + retry_next_day&#39;&#10;    - &#39;notify_user_after_3_consecutive_failures&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># ~/.hermes/config.yaml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">curator</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  schedule</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'daily'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  at</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'03:00'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  tz</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Asia/Shanghai'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  prerequisites</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'all_sessions_idle'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'disk_free_gb > 5'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  on_failure</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'log + retry_next_day'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'notify_user_after_3_consecutive_failures'</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>配置项</th>\n<th>语义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>schedule</code></td>\n<td>daily / hourly / cron expression</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>at</code></td>\n<td>触发时间（带 <code>tz</code>）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>prerequisites</code></td>\n<td>启动前置条件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>on_failure</code></td>\n<td>失败处理策略</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>curator 是&quot;系统级&quot;cron，与下面用户自定义 skill 走同一个 scheduler 但有不同的 reliability 要求——curator 失败必须重试且通知用户。</p>\n<h2 id=\"用户自定义-cron-skill-范式\">用户自定义 cron skill 范式</h2><p>用户写一个 skill 标注 <code>trigger: cron</code> 即可注入到 scheduler。典型场景：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>cron 表达式</th>\n<th>行为</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>每日早间 brief</td>\n<td><code>0 9 * * *</code></td>\n<td>拉前一天 MEMORY summary 投 IM</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>周一晨会 prep</td>\n<td><code>0 8 * * 1</code></td>\n<td>拉上周 OKR 进展 + 本周日历</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>月底总结</td>\n<td><code>0 23 28-31 * *</code></td>\n<td>月底最后一天，跑总结写文档</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>每小时 health check</td>\n<td><code>0 * * * *</code></td>\n<td>检查 agent 各模块状态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>每 5 分钟轮询</td>\n<td><code>*/5 * * * *</code></td>\n<td>检查未读 PR / issue</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# ~/.hermes/skills/daily-brief/skill.yaml&#10;name: daily-brief&#10;trigger:&#10;  cron: &#39;7 9 * * *&#39; # 9:07 而非整点 0，避开 cron 高峰&#10;  tz: &#39;Asia/Shanghai&#39;&#10;run:&#10;  - shell: &#39;hermes summarize --range &quot;yesterday&quot;&#39;&#10;  - shell: &#39;lark-cli im send --chat-id &quot;$DAILY_BRIEF_CHAT&quot; --md $OUT&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># ~/.hermes/skills/daily-brief/skill.yaml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">daily-brief</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">trigger</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  cron</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'7 9 * * *'</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 9:07 而非整点 0，避开 cron 高峰</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  tz</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Asia/Shanghai'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">shell</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'hermes summarize --range \"yesterday\"'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">shell</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'lark-cli im send --chat-id \"$DAILY_BRIEF_CHAT\" --md $OUT'</span></span></code></pre></div><p>注意 cron 表达式用 <code>9:07</code> 而非 <code>9:00</code>——大量 cron 任务同时落在整点会让 IM / API 突发，错峰几分钟显著减少 rate-limit 撞车（这点在 schedule skill 文档里也强调）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"cron-与-hooks-transform-管线协同\">Cron 与 hooks transform 管线协同</h2><p>Cron 触发 event 后不会&quot;直接执行命令&quot;——它走 <a href=\"../../modules-deep/hooks-transform-pipeline/\"><code>../../2_modules-deep/4_hooks-transform-pipeline/</code></a> 讲的 transform 管线。流程：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;  CRON[&quot;cron fires&quot;] --&gt; EV[&quot;CronEvent&quot;]&#10;  EV --&gt; T1[&quot;transform: enrich context&quot;]&#10;  T1 --&gt; T2[&quot;transform: persona resolve&quot;]&#10;  T2 --&gt; T3[&quot;transform: permission check&quot;]&#10;  T3 --&gt; ACT[&quot;action: shell / API call&quot;]&#10;  ACT --&gt; AUD[&quot;audit log&quot;]&#10;  ACT --&gt; NTF[&quot;notify if configured&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n  CRON[\"cron fires\"] --&gt; EV[\"CronEvent\"]\n  EV --&gt; T1[\"transform: enrich context\"]\n  T1 --&gt; T2[\"transform: persona resolve\"]\n  T2 --&gt; T3[\"transform: permission check\"]\n  T3 --&gt; ACT[\"action: shell / API call\"]\n  ACT --&gt; AUD[\"audit log\"]\n  ACT --&gt; NTF[\"notify if configured\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Transform 阶段</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>enrich context</td>\n<td>注入当前时间 / persona / 环境变量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>persona resolve</td>\n<td>决定以哪个 persona 运行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>permission check</td>\n<td>校验 persona 是否可执行此 cron</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>(optional) human-confirm</td>\n<td>高敏感 cron 可要求 push confirm</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>persona resolve 是关键——同一个 daily-brief skill 在不同 persona 下行为不同（work persona 走工作 chat、hobby persona 走个人 chat）。cron skill 在 <code>skill.yaml</code> 里声明 <code>persona: work_focus</code> 或 <code>persona: $auto</code>（按时间窗口推断）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"失败重试与时间漂移修正\">失败重试与时间漂移修正</h2><p>Cron 调度不是&quot;承诺准时&quot;，是&quot;在指定时间后尽快触发一次&quot;。系统休眠 / 进程崩溃 / 时钟跳变都会导致漂移。Hermes scheduler 应对：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  EXP[&quot;expected fire time&quot;] --&gt; CHECK[&quot;check missed?&quot;]&#10;  CHECK -- not missed --&gt; NORM[&quot;normal fire&quot;]&#10;  CHECK -- missed --&gt; CAT[&quot;catch-up policy&quot;]&#10;  CAT --&gt; CAT_ONCE[&quot;once: 仅补跑一次&quot;]&#10;  CAT --&gt; CAT_ALL[&quot;all: 补跑所有错过实例&quot;]&#10;  CAT --&gt; CAT_SKIP[&quot;skip: 跳过所有错过&quot;]&#10;  NORM --&gt; RUN[&quot;run&quot;]&#10;  CAT_ONCE --&gt; RUN&#10;  CAT_ALL --&gt; RUN\">flowchart TD\n  EXP[\"expected fire time\"] --&gt; CHECK[\"check missed?\"]\n  CHECK -- not missed --&gt; NORM[\"normal fire\"]\n  CHECK -- missed --&gt; CAT[\"catch-up policy\"]\n  CAT --&gt; CAT_ONCE[\"once: 仅补跑一次\"]\n  CAT --&gt; CAT_ALL[\"all: 补跑所有错过实例\"]\n  CAT --&gt; CAT_SKIP[\"skip: 跳过所有错过\"]\n  NORM --&gt; RUN[\"run\"]\n  CAT_ONCE --&gt; RUN\n  CAT_ALL --&gt; RUN</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>catch-up 策略</th>\n<th>行为</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>once</code></td>\n<td>错过 N 次只补跑最近一次（默认）</td>\n<td>daily brief / 通知</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>all</code></td>\n<td>错过 N 次依次补跑全部</td>\n<td>累积型任务（少见）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>skip</code></td>\n<td>错过全部跳过</td>\n<td>与时间强相关任务（如打卡）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>合理默认是 <code>once</code>——错过的早间 brief 在中午醒来时跑一次足够，跑三次反而 spam。打卡 / 闹钟类用 <code>skip</code>——错过就错过。</p>\n<h2 id=\"失败重试与告警\">失败重试与告警</h2><p>任务失败时的策略：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"on_failure:&#10;  retry:&#10;    max_attempts: 3&#10;    backoff: &#39;exponential&#39; # 1m, 5m, 25m&#10;  alert:&#10;    after_consecutive: 3 # 连续 3 次失败才告警&#10;    channel: &#39;lark_dm_self&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">on_failure</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  retry</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    max_attempts</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    backoff</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'exponential'</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 1m, 5m, 25m</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  alert</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    after_consecutive</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 连续 3 次失败才告警</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    channel</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'lark_dm_self'</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>失败类别</th>\n<th>处理</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>暂时网络错误</td>\n<td>指数回退重试</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>API 鉴权失败</td>\n<td>立即告警，无重试</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内部 bug（panic）</td>\n<td>立即告警 + audit</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>资源不足（disk full）</td>\n<td>等待 + 重试</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>连续 3 次失败才告警——避免单次抖动 spam push。但鉴权类失败（token 过期）必须立即告警，因为再多重试也无济于事。</p>\n<h2 id=\"时钟跳变与-dst\">时钟跳变与 DST</h2><p>cron 的两个隐藏陷阱：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>现象</th>\n<th>表现</th>\n<th>处理</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>系统休眠 / 待机</td>\n<td>wake 后 cron 时间已过</td>\n<td>用 monotonic timer 检测 missed</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DST 切换</td>\n<td>02:30 任务在 spring-forward 不存在</td>\n<td>推后到下一存在的 02:30 / 提前 1h</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NTP 时钟跳变</td>\n<td>时间向前跳跃</td>\n<td>重计算 next fire time</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时区配置错误</td>\n<td>任务在错误的本地时间触发</td>\n<td>tz 必须显式而非依赖 system tz</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Hermes scheduler 用 monotonic clock + wall clock 双源校对——任何不一致都 log warning 并按 wall clock 重新计算。</p>\n<h2 id=\"cron-skill-实战-daily-memory-summary\">Cron skill 实战：daily memory summary</h2><p>完整端到端例子——每日早 9:07 把昨天的 memory 拉成 summary 投 IM：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# ~/.hermes/skills/daily-memory-summary/skill.yaml&#10;name: daily-memory-summary&#10;trigger:&#10;  cron: &#39;7 9 * * *&#39;&#10;  tz: &#39;Asia/Shanghai&#39;&#10;  catch_up: &#39;once&#39;&#10;persona: work_focus&#10;permission:&#10;  - &#39;read_memory&#39;&#10;  - &#39;send_im&#39;&#10;run:&#10;  - shell: |&#10;      hermes recall --range &quot;yesterday&quot; --format markdown &gt; /tmp/brief.md&#10;  - shell: |&#10;      lark-cli im send \\&#10;        --chat-id &quot;$DAILY_BRIEF_CHAT&quot; \\&#10;        --md /tmp/brief.md&#10;on_failure:&#10;  retry:&#10;    max_attempts: 3&#10;    backoff: exponential&#10;  alert:&#10;    after_consecutive: 3&#10;    channel: lark_dm_self\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># ~/.hermes/skills/daily-memory-summary/skill.yaml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">daily-memory-summary</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">trigger</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  cron</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'7 9 * * *'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  tz</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Asia/Shanghai'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  catch_up</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'once'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">persona</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">work_focus</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">permission</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'read_memory'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'send_im'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">shell</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      hermes recall --range \"yesterday\" --format markdown > /tmp/brief.md</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">shell</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      lark-cli im send \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        --chat-id \"$DAILY_BRIEF_CHAT\" \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        --md /tmp/brief.md</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">on_failure</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  retry</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    max_attempts</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    backoff</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">exponential</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  alert</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    after_consecutive</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    channel</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">lark_dm_self</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>字段</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>persona</code></td>\n<td>决定运行身份</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>permission</code></td>\n<td>声明所需权限，scheduler 启动期校验</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>run</code></td>\n<td>步骤化命令，顺序执行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>catch_up</code></td>\n<td>漂移恢复策略</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>on_failure</code></td>\n<td>失败处理</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这套 skill yaml 提交后 scheduler 自动注册——无需 restart agent。运行时通过 transform 管线确认 persona 与 permission 后实际跑 shell。</p>\n<h2 id=\"陷阱与常见问题\">陷阱与常见问题</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>所有 cron 都写 <code>0 9 * * *</code></strong>：所有用户全球 9:00 整撞 API rate-limit。错峰几分钟（<code>7 9</code>、<code>13 9</code>）显著减少撞车。</li>\n<li><strong>不写 <code>tz</code></strong>：默认 UTC——admin 在中国常忘改，导致任务在错误时间触发。强制 <code>tz</code>。</li>\n<li><strong><code>catch_up: all</code> 用错地方</strong>：错过 7 天的 daily brief 一次性跑 7 次刷 IM——用 <code>once</code> 即可。</li>\n<li><strong>persona 漂移</strong>：cron 注册时 persona 还在白名单，后来管理员删了 persona，scheduler 启动期校验失败。skill yaml 改动后必须 reload 校验。</li>\n<li><strong>DST 跨时区任务</strong>：用户在跨时区差旅时 cron 还按原 tz 触发，导致&quot;早间 brief&quot;半夜响。可加 <code>follow_user_tz: true</code> 让 scheduler 用当前时区。</li>\n<li><strong>shell 命令引号缺失</strong>：<code>--md $OUT</code> 在路径含空格时失败——脚本步骤必须严格 quote 变量。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>cron 周期任务是 personal-agent 自动化的核心模式。Hermes curator + 用户自定义 cron skill 共用同一 scheduler，所有触发都走 hooks transform 管线（enrich → persona resolve → permission check → action）。失败重试默认指数回退、连续 3 次告警；catch-up 默认 once 避免补跑过多；时钟跳变 / DST / 跨时区是隐藏雷区。整套设计把&quot;准时&quot;放在第二位，把&quot;可观察 + fail-secure + 不 spam&quot;放在第一位。下一篇讲 IM 触发自动化——把同一套 transform 管线接到用户主动输入的 slash command 上。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Cron 周期任务与 hooks 协同","id":"cron-周期任务与-hooks-协同"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Hermes curator schedule","id":"hermes-curator-schedule"},{"level":2,"text":"用户自定义 cron skill 范式","id":"用户自定义-cron-skill-范式"},{"level":2,"text":"Cron 与 hooks transform 管线协同","id":"cron-与-hooks-transform-管线协同"},{"level":2,"text":"失败重试与时间漂移修正","id":"失败重试与时间漂移修正"},{"level":2,"text":"失败重试与告警","id":"失败重试与告警"},{"level":2,"text":"时钟跳变与 DST","id":"时钟跳变与-dst"},{"level":2,"text":"Cron skill 实战：daily memory summary","id":"cron-skill-实战-daily-memory-summary"},{"level":2,"text":"陷阱与常见问题","id":"陷阱与常见问题"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"智能家居集成与安全策略","url":"/l-doc-books/c/ai-books/personal-agents/horizontal-pillars/automation-workflows/smart-home-integration"},"next":{"title":"IM 触发自动化","url":"/l-doc-books/c/ai-books/personal-agents/horizontal-pillars/automation-workflows/im-triggered-automation"}}